{"3138400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "IDOLZ", "steam_appid": 3138400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INSULTS HIT HARDER THAN PUNCHES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In IDOLZ, winning isn't just about fighting. Roast your opponent, charge your Flow bar and unleash ridiculous specials that humiliate everyone watching<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/60de8e5ebdb81be791e09cd6902cbd3e.poster.avif?t=1786472934\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/60de8e5ebdb81be791e09cd6902cbd3e.webm?t=1786472934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/60de8e5ebdb81be791e09cd6902cbd3e.mp4?t=1786472934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE ON ONE. NO MERCY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 1v1 online battles where every match is a mix of skill, trash talk and pure chaos. Read your rival, bait their mistakes, and finish them with style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online 1v1 PvP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick matches, easy to learn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roster of absurd fighters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flow-powered special attacks </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made to be clipped and shared</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/585246ca947446dc58b91e25dfb5576e.poster.avif?t=1786472934\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/585246ca947446dc58b91e25dfb5576e.webm?t=1786472934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/585246ca947446dc58b91e25dfb5576e.mp4?t=1786472934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROAST YOUR RIVALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use customizable insults mid-battle to pressure your opponent and charge devastating abilities. The meaner you play, the harder you hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/aeb6e8b6bb0c6fbf354bb12301c7e524.poster.avif?t=1786472934\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/aeb6e8b6bb0c6fbf354bb12301c7e524.webm?t=1786472934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/aeb6e8b6bb0c6fbf354bb12301c7e524.mp4?t=1786472934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABSURD SPECIAL ATTACKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From diamond storms to rogue androids, every special is built to steal the spotlight and humiliate your enemy in spectacular fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/6040a3efa5490a498fc1d84343e17344.poster.avif?t=1786472934\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/6040a3efa5490a498fc1d84343e17344.webm?t=1786472934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/6040a3efa5490a498fc1d84343e17344.mp4?t=1786472934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR IDOL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your fighter with skins, music, intros, celebrations and insult packs. Build a style that's unmistakably, obnoxiously yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MADE FOR CLIPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IDOLZ is built for rage moments, comeback clips and unforgettable online battles. If it didn't make your friend ragequit, did it even happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INSULTS HIT HARDER THAN PUNCHES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In IDOLZ, winning isn't just about fighting. Roast your opponent, charge your Flow bar and unleash ridiculous specials that humiliate everyone watching<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/60de8e5ebdb81be791e09cd6902cbd3e.poster.avif?t=1786472934\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/60de8e5ebdb81be791e09cd6902cbd3e.webm?t=1786472934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/60de8e5ebdb81be791e09cd6902cbd3e.mp4?t=1786472934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE ON ONE. NO MERCY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 1v1 online battles where every match is a mix of skill, trash talk and pure chaos. Read your rival, bait their mistakes, and finish them with style.</p><u