g></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From diamond storms to rogue androids, every special is built to steal the spotlight and humiliate your enemy in spectacular fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/6040a3efa5490a498fc1d84343e17344.poster.avif?t=1786472934\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/6040a3efa5490a498fc1d84343e17344.webm?t=1786472934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/extras/6040a3efa5490a498fc1d84343e17344.mp4?t=1786472934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR IDOL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your fighter with skins, music, intros, celebrations and insult packs. Build a style that's unmistakably, obnoxiously yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MADE FOR CLIPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IDOLZ is built for rage moments, comeback clips and unforgettable online battles. If it didn't make your friend ragequit, did it even happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Fight dirty, roast harder. IDOLZ is an online 1v1 fighting comedy where insults power your special attacks. Humiliate your rivals, charge your Flow and unleash absurd abilities to become the king of chaos.", "supported_languages": "Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/b7eb5c248543f440dc758b365a3c439db62d1fd3/header.jpg?t=1786472934", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138400/45434e8